#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID does not expose separate end-user registration and login products. Hosted Auth starts from the same identifier step and decides login or user creation from organization policy and account state."
msgstr "XID n'expose pas de produits séparés pour l'inscription et la connexion des utilisateurs finaux. L'authentification hébergée démarre depuis la même étape d'identifiant et décide entre connexion ou création d'utilisateur selon la politique de l'organisation et l'état du compte."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID exposes inbound SCIM Service Provider endpoints for external IdPs. Downstream SaaS SCIM push clients have local fake-SaaS evidence, but production support still requires real SaaS admin L4."
msgstr "FR: XID exposes inbound SCIM Service Provider endpoints for external IdPs. Downstream SaaS SCIM push clients have local fake-SaaS evidence, but production support still requires real SaaS admin L4."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID exposes organization-scoped SCIM 2.0 APIs under <0>/scim/v2/organizations/{organization_id}</0>. User and group resources are addressed with the organization ID in the path."
msgstr "XID expose des API SCIM 2.0 limitées à l'organisation sous <0>/scim/v2/organizations/{organization_id}</0>. Les ressources utilisateur et groupe sont adressées avec l'ID d'organisation dans le chemin."

#: apps/server/src/lib/page-seo-messages.ts
msgid "XID is an edge-native identity platform for OIDC, OAuth, organization RBAC, enterprise SSO, SCIM, passkeys, and networkless JWT verification on Cloudflare."
msgstr "XID est une plateforme d’identité edge native pour OIDC, OAuth, RBAC organisationnel, SSO entreprise, SCIM, passkeys et vérification JWT sans réseau sur Cloudflare.organisationnel, SSO entreprise, SCIM, passkeys et vérification JWT sans réseau sur Cloudflare.organisationnel, SSO entreprise, SCIM, passkeys et vérification JWT sans réseau sur Cloudflare."

#: apps/server/src/routes/docs/index.tsx
msgid "XID is an identity provider. The instance domain is the OIDC issuer, API base URL, Hosted Auth base URL, and console base URL. Organizations provide policy, branding, membership, and resource isolation."
msgstr "XID est un fournisseur d'identité. Le domaine de l'instance est l'émetteur OIDC, l'URL de base API, l'URL de base de l'authentification hébergée et l'URL de base de la console. Les organisations fournissent la politique, la marque, les appartenances et l'isolation des ressources."

#: apps/server/src/routes/home/HeroSection.tsx
#~ msgid "XID is an OIDC / OAuth identity provider with explicit support levels, organization RBAC, provider-ready enterprise SAML/OIDC federation, inbound SCIM, local downstream SaaS SAML and SCIM baselines, and Web, Backend, React, and Next.js SDKs. It runs on Cloudflare's global network, while real provider and SaaS production support remains tied to L4 evidence instead of local mock runs."
#~ msgstr "FR: XID is an OIDC / OAuth identity provider with explicit support levels, organization RBAC, provider-ready enterprise SAML/OIDC federation, inbound SCIM, local downstream SaaS SAML and SCIM baselines, and Web, Backend, React, and Next.js SDKs. It runs on Cloudflare's global network, while real provider and SaaS production support remains tied to L4 evidence instead of local mock runs."

#: apps/server/src/routes/home/PlatformSection.tsx
